{
  "family": "wsfed",
  "about": "WS-Federation's Passive Requestor Profile landing (POST and GET /wsfed) and GET /wsfedresponse. Recorded against the api as it was before the family switched to the model (docs/v0.9.6/data-model.md). The landing is what an identity provider's browser reaches, so it is sent as a form or a query string, and answers with a 302; a sign-in's Location carries a stash id that is new every run, hence volatile, and a sign-out's does not. Nothing here connects anywhere.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "landing (POST): a wresult is stashed and the browser sent on",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/wsfed",
      "form": {
        "wa": "wsignin1.0",
        "wresult": "<t:RequestSecurityTokenResponse xmlns:t=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/02/trust\"><t:TokenType>urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:assertion</t:TokenType></t:RequestSecurityTokenResponse>",
        "wctx": "wire-ctx"
      },
      "volatile": [
        "location"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": 302,
        "body": {
          "(not JSON)": ""
        },
        "location": "https://client:3000/wsfed_response.html?id=6306cf6a6398130593271e9b949983a5"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "landing (POST): a field nobody expects does not stop it",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/wsfed",
      "form": {
        "wa": "wsignin1.0",
        "wresult": "<t:RequestSecurityTokenResponse xmlns:t=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/02/trust\"><t:TokenType>urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:assertion</t:TokenType></t:RequestSecurityTokenResponse>",
        "wtrealm": "urn:x",
        "x": "y"
      },
      "volatile": [
        "location"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "status": 302,
        "body": {
          "(not JSON)": ""
        },
        "location": "https://client:3000/wsfed_response.html?id=6b8a6bf9901a8b1a010f310759507e68"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "landing (POST): a sign-out carries no token",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/wsfed",
      "form": {
        "wa": "wsignout1.0"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 302,
        "body": {
          "(not JSON)": ""
        },
        "location": "https://client:3000/wsfed_response.html?signout=wsignout1.0"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "landing (POST): an empty form is a sign-out of no kind",
